          "^cyan;<target> needsss to know that Floran is one to fear!",
          "^cyan;Floran wants more ressspect around here."
        ],
        "glitch" : [
            "^cyan;Aggressive. I need <target> to be compliant, and I have a plan to make it happen.",
            "^cyan;Cunning. I have decided that <target> could be a little more terrified of me... I have a plan."
        ],
        "default" : [
