  "prerequisites" : [],
  "title" : "^orange;Let's Get Technical",
  "text" : "I've been developing technology that will enable the user to swiftly dash from one point to another, but I'm lacking a few crucial components for my ^orange;prototype^white;. Could you help me by ^green;bringing me ^orange;10 Copper Bars^white;?",
  "completionText" : "You brought me the parts! Wonderful! With these the ^orange;Dash Tech^white; should be ready for action, but there's only one way to be sure...",
