  "title" : "Fetch the Floran Artifact",
  "text" : "The clues you collected reveal that the ^orange;Floran artifact^reset; is enshrined in ^orange;The Ceremonial Hunting Caverns^reset;. Judging from what I've found out, you'll need to ^green;compete in a ritual hunt to get it^reset;. I've given SAIL the co-ordinates you need. Be careful dear.",
